{title: Chal Chal Ve Tu Bandeya}
{artist: Arijit Singh Sharib Toshi}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Chal, chal ve tu bandeya [Em]uss galiye,        Jahaan [D]koi kisi ko na jaane
Kya [G]rehna wahaan par [Em]sun bandeya,        Jahaan [D]apne hi na pehchaane
Reh [G]gaye hain jo tujhme,        Mere [D]lamhe lauta de
Meri [Em]aankhon mein aa [G]ke,        Mujhe [D]thoda rula de [G]
[G]Chal, chal ve tu bandeya [Em]uss galiye,        Jahaan [D]koi kisi ko na jaane
[G]Khwab jo huey hain khandar,        [Em]Khwab hi nahi thhe
Ik [C]neend thi neem [D]si.. haaye,        [Bm]Kho diya hai tune jisko
[Em]Tera hi nahi tha,        Ik [C]haar thi [D]jeet si
[D]Kitna rulayega [Em]ye toh bata,        [C]Rabba ve tujhe hai tere [D]rab da waasta
[G]Chal, chal ve tu bandeya [Em]uss galiye,        Jahaan [D]koi kisi ko na jaane
Kya [G]rehna wahaan par [Em]sun bandeya,        Jahaan [D]apne hi na pehchaane
